sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over Product, CN: Precondition: connected, IoCapabilities set to keyboard or keyboardDisplay

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=false, passkey=485923)

    Note over Product: User enters displayed passkey

    Product->>CN: GapCentral.AuthenticateWithPasskey(485923)

    alt Correct passkey
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    else Wrong passkey
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=passkeyEntryFailed)
    else Timeout (30s SMP timeout)
        CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(<br>pairedSuccessfully=false, reason=timeout)
    end
